title: "poster-kit: a themeable poster repository (YAML, Markdown, reportlab)"
abstract: >-
  Template repository for conference posters: texts in Markdown, structure in YAML,
  themes for colours and typefaces, and a small Python engine that renders a
  byte-reproducible vector PDF with the type size fitted to the page.
